---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
const s = Astro.locals.settings;
const updated = '2026-10-06';
---
<ContentLayout title="Privacy Policy" h1="Privacy Policy" path="/privacy" updated={updated} description="How BamaMotors collects, uses, shares and protects your information, and the choices and rights you have over your data.">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how BamaMotors (“we,” “us”) handles information when you use BamaMotors.com. We keep it plain and specific.</p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account information:</strong> name, email, phone (optional) and a securely hashed password. We never store your password in readable form.</li>
      <li><strong>Inquiries you send:</strong> the details you enter in contact, price, test-drive or financing forms, and the vehicle or dealer you contacted.</li>
      <li><strong>Dealer information:</strong> business name, address, phone, email, hours, license number and listings provided by dealerships.</li>
      <li><strong>Usage information:</strong> pages viewed and basic device/browser data. We store a one-way hash of IP addresses for fraud and spam prevention rather than the raw address.</li>
      <li><strong>Location (optional):</strong> if you tap “Use my location,” your browser shares approximate coordinates, which we use once to find the nearest Alabama ZIP code. We don't store them.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To deliver your inquiry to the dealer you choose and send you a confirmation.</li>
      <li>To run your account, saved vehicles and dashboards.</li>
      <li>To keep the marketplace safe — rate limiting, spam and fraud prevention.</li>
      <li>To improve the site and measure performance.</li>
      <li>To send service emails such as password resets. We do not send marketing email without your permission.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How we share information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>With the dealer you contact.</strong> When you submit a form, that dealership receives your inquiry details.</li>
      <li><strong>With service providers</strong> that host the site, deliver email and process payments for dealers, only as needed to provide those services.</li>
      <li><strong>For legal reasons</strong> when required by law or to protect users and the marketplace.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>We do not sell your personal information.</strong></p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>We use one essential cookie to keep you signed in. If analytics is enabled, we use Google Analytics 4 with IP anonymization to understand aggregate site usage. You can block analytics cookies in your browser settings without affecting core features.</p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>BamaMotors may show ads served by Google AdSense and other third-party vendors to keep the site free for shoppers.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites.</li>
      <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this site and/or other sites on the Internet. Learn how Google uses information from sites that use its services at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener" target="_blank">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.</li>
      <li>You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>, or opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
      <li>Ads are clearly separated from listings and editorial content. Advertisers do not influence our guides; see our <a href="/editorial-policy">Editorial Policy</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Your state privacy rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on where you live in the United States (for example, California, Virginia, Colorado or Connecticut), you may have the right to know what personal information we collect, to request deletion or correction, and to opt out of the sale or sharing of personal information for targeted advertising. We do not sell personal information. To exercise any of these rights, <a href="/contact">contact us</a> — we honor requests from all users regardless of state.</p>
    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>We keep account data while your account is active. Inquiries are retained so dealers and shoppers can reference them and for record-keeping, and are deleted or anonymized when no longer needed. You may ask us to delete your data at any time.</p>
    <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
    <p>You can access and update your account details from <a href="/account/settings">account settings</a>. To request a copy or deletion of your data, <a href="/contact">contact us</a> and choose “Privacy request.” We honor these requests for all users.</p>
    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>We use HTTPS, hashed passwords, secure HttpOnly session cookies, rate limiting and role-based access controls. No system is perfectly secure, so please use a unique password.</p>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>BamaMotors is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If we make material changes, we will update the date at the top of this page.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>{s.contact_email && <> or email <a href={`mailto:${s.contact_email}`}>{s.contact_email}</a></>}.</p>
  </div>
</ContentLayout>
